<!-- MATH 14 Skeletal Notes                                                -->
<!-- Section: The Divergence Theorem                                       -->
<!--                                                                       -->
<!-- Skeletal (fill-in) version of the section of the same name in the     -->
<!-- completed MATH 14 notes.  The definition of divergence in 3D and the  -->
<!-- statement of the divergence theorem are kept; the proof and the four  -->
<!-- worked examples are replaced by blank workspace boxes, each preceded  -->
<!-- by a one-line instruction.  File name and xml:ids are unchanged.      -->
<!--                                                                       -->
<!-- Figures: all kept (the two field plots, the proof solid, the radial   -->
<!-- field on the sphere, and every video); each is the check on the box   -->
